
================================================================================
                    💰 THE VAULT OF MEMORY
================================================================================

You have entered an asymmetric room with shards of glass
arranged along the floor in haphazard patterns.

As you move past them, they each appear to turn slightly,
as if watching you go.

On the wall is a picture of two goblets:
one glows brightly,
the other shines darkly.

================================================================================
                  ENVIRONMENT VARIABLES
================================================================================

The vault teaches the art of MEMORY — storing knowledge
in variables that persist throughout your adventure.

COMMAND                  PURPOSE
--------                 --------
export VAR=value         Store a value in memory
echo $VAR                Recall a stored value
export I=item,$I         Add an item to your inventory
echo $I                  Check your inventory
let "HP=HP-5"            Perform arithmetic on variables
unset VAR                Forget a variable

================================================================================
                   THE GLASS GUARDIAN
================================================================================

The shards of glass on the floor are not mere decoration.
They form a guardian — an interactive encounter.

    ./glass              Face the glass guardian

Be prepared: you may need items from earlier rooms.

================================================================================
                    DEEPER PATHS
================================================================================

Beyond the glass lies the stronghold, where the legendary
goblet awaits. The goblet is said to unlock passages to
realms beyond mortal comprehension.

    stronghold/     The heart of the vault (contains the goblet)

The stronghold branches further:
    nursery/        A garden of growing knowledge
    lab/            An alchemy room (beware the ghost!)

NAVIGATION:
    cd stronghold   Venture deeper into the vault
    cd ..           Return to the entrance

